Headings inside containers are not wrapped

```
> # Quoted
>
> Quoted body.

:::
# Divved
:::

- # In an item

  Item body.
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="Quoted">Quoted</h1>
  <p>Quoted body.</p>
</blockquote>
<div>
  <h1 id="Divved">Divved</h1>
</div>
<ul>
  <li>
    <h1 id="In-an-item">In an item</h1>
    <p>Item body.</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
